<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Hy4 preview vs GLM-5.3 vs Kimi K3 vs DeepSeek-V4 Flash</h2>

<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-4">2026 年 8 月最该对比的四个中国开源旗舰：</p>

<div class="overflow-x-auto my-6"><table class="min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg">

